---
description: Overnight Foundry v2 operating rails
alwaysApply: true
---

Selection factory. Not a revive graveyard. Not a canvas app.

- Lanes: utility, watch, ext, service, ops. Never revive.
- Loop must include Deploy and Measure.
- Incubator+Shipped max 4. Growing 2. Maintenance 2.
- Draft PR only. Human merges.
- First winner to build is `apps/web`, the independent dashboard.
- XP from usage, not stars.
- After catalog or metric changes run Measure + dashboard render.
